        "full_content": "Which Google Pixel 11 Pro Fold color should you buy?\nThere are only two options, so this won't take too long.\nGoogle's makes only one, large-form foldable every year. This time around, the Pixel 11 Pro Fold comes in just two colors, which is the same as every other Pixel foldable ever released. The shades aren't even radically different from the previous-gen Pixel 10 Pro Fold, which came in a light green option and another gray-ish colorway.\nWhile the Pixel 11 Pro Fold doesn't come in a lighter colorway, it does offer one safe and one bold option, so anyone looking to own it is sure to be pleased. These are your options.\nYour choice is simple: It's either green or black\nWhy you can trust Android Central\nOlive\nI'm loving the Pixel 11 Pro Fold in this darker, deeper olive green hue with gold accents. It is not too far away from the lighter Pixel 10 Pro Fold in Jade, and yet it is different enough to differentiate the two Pixel foldables.\nObsidian\nUnlike last year, the Pixel 11 Pro Fold actually offers a black colorway. This is also the only colorway that comes in a 1TB storage variant, and apart from the U.S., the only color option in most regions.\nWhen picking a Pixel 11 Pro Fold color, ask yourself how much storage you want first\nThe Google Pixel 11 Pro Fold comes in two colors, with one being a staple black colorway and the other being a more fun option. Obsidian is the classic black hue that is favored by many, and it is also the only Pixel 11 Pro Fold that is offered with 1TB storage. This actually makes your decision a little easier, even if it displeases some folks.\nRight off the bat, you can eliminate the Pixel 11 Pro Fold in Olive if you want 1TB onboard. It makes sense to want that much memory if you're going to shell out two grand on a smartphone. You don't upgrade a phone like this every year either, so a generous amount of storage is a dire need for many.\nHowever, if you're happy with 256GB and 512GB options, and prefer to be more daring in your choices, Olive is all style and glamour. This deep green Google Pixel 11 Pro Fold colorway comes with golden hardware, giving it an incredibly chic and luxurious air. If you want to make a statement, this is certainly the color to get.\nGet the latest news from Android Central, your trusted companion in the world of Android\nNamerah enjoys geeking out over accessories, gadgets, and all sorts of smart tech. She spends her time guzzling coffee, writing, casual gaming, and cuddling with her furry best friends. Find her on Twitter @NamerahS.",
