        "full_content": "Best Google Pixel 11 Pro XL cases\nThese cases are extra large and in charge.\nYour search for the best Google Pixel 11 Pro XL cases begins and ends here. The largest, fastest charging, and most long-lasting of the Pixel 11 series, the Pixel 11 Pro XL offers generous screen real estate with its 6.8-inch Super Actua OLED display. A bigger phone definitely means you have more grounds to cover in terms of scratch and drop resistance. You should also look for added grip, as a bigger, heavier phone is more likely to fall accidentally. All of my top picks have this covered, and more, so take your time and browse through this guide.\nCases fit for the mighty Pixel 11 Pro XL\nWhy you can trust Android Central\nBest overall\nThe official Google Pixelsnap Case for the Pixel 11 Pro XL comes in the four colors of the Pixel. It has a soft lining to preserve the chassis of the phone, and Google promises everyday scratch and drop resistance and a one-year warranty for the case.\nBest with stand\nTORRAS designed a new lineup of cases for the Pixel 11 series. The Q3 Air for the Pixel 11 Pro XL is a lightweight, smokey black case with a magnetic rotating ring on the back. It uses proprietary AirPro Cushion technology to reinforce shock resistance.\nBest premium\nMous isn't the cheapest brand, but its sleek cases undergo rigorous drop tests — which you can see on YouTube! The Mous Marine Limitless Phone Case is grippy, Pixelsnap-compatible, and adds rugged impact absorption in a slim profile.\nBest leather\nThe Bellroy Leather Case with Pixelsnap for Pixel 11 Pro XL uses top-quality leather and comes in four shades that go with the phone's own colors. They aren't exact matches, but the adapted colors look splendid in the leather grain.\nBest clear\nSpigen is usually my got-to clear case brand, but for a larger phone like the Pixel 11 Pro XL, I highly suggest the more robust Poetic Guardian case instead. This clear case has a shock-proof frame, one screen protector, a ring stand, and 20ft drop protection.\nBest heavy-duty\nSUPCASE is another favorite of mine, and I've relied on the brand for years just like Poetic and Spigen. Their Unicorn Beetle Grip case is spectacular as expected, delivering rugged drop-proofing, a screen guard, and a magnetic ring stand.\nBest designs\nThe grippiest of sides and the swankiest of designs, these are two merits of the Dbrand Grip Case for the Pixel 11 Pro XL. It adds reasonable scratch and drop resistance too, and has a magnetic ring embedded within. Some colors/patterns cost most, though.\nBest classic\nI would be remiss if I didn't mention Spigen, and there's no case more well known that the classic Nano Pop. This Blueberry Navy shade has been a hit for many years. Now that Spigen has added magnetic support, it is a perfect affordable Pixel 11 Pro XL case.\nBest non-slip\nThe Ringke Onyx Magnetic Google Pixel 11 Pro XL Case has a sandstone-like texture that is wonderfully grippy, preventing accidental slips. The dark green variant looks particularly striking. You get lanyard holes on the sides of the magnetic case too.\nYou have options on options on options when buying a Pixel 11 Pro XL case\nNo matter your style preference or budget range, there's a handsome Google Pixel 11 Pro XL case available out there. Instead of spending hours trying to find the perfect match for yourself, just read through this buying guide that I've put together for you. I test cases for a living, and have gone through everything available to narrow it down to only the very best options here.\nGenerally speaking, most people will be very happy with the Google Pixelsnap Case for the Pixel 11 Pro XL. It fits like a glove, it has Pixelsnap support, it adds scratch and drop resistance, it has a soft lining inside, and it matches all the colorways of the Pixel 11 Pro XL. If you score a neat pre-order deal, you can save up to $600, so the hefty price tag of the official case won't hurt either.\nNow for those on the hunt for more than a basic first-party option, there's no shortage of options. Depending on how much money you'd like to spend, what level of drop protection you want, and whether you want extras like a stand, I have rounded up the best Pixel 11 Pro XL cases in every category. If you can go all out, the Mous Marine Limitless Phone Case for Pixel 11 Pro XL is a robust drop-proof case in a very sleek form factor. Poetic offers an affordable version of this in a clear case too, so if that's more accessible, you should check out the Poetic Guardian case for the Pixel 11 Pro XL.\nGet the latest news from Android Central, your trusted companion in the world of Android\nNamerah enjoys geeking out over accessories, gadgets, and all sorts of smart tech. She spends her time guzzling coffee, writing, casual gaming, and cuddling with her furry best friends. Find her on Twitter @NamerahS.",
