        "title": "Trump DOJ Brings Criminal Charges Against Outspoken Critic of Far-Right",
        "link": "https://talkingpointsmemo.com/news/trump-doj-brings-criminal-charges-against-outspoken-critic-of-far-right",
        "source": "TPM – Talking Points Memo",
