articulars and discovered him living under a concealed identity, establishing himself as a successful businessman in the Bijbehara area,\" it said.\n\"Long pursuit by the police team brought results, and the accused responsible for the death of innocent persons was arrested and produced before the TADA Court on 13th August 2026 for further legal proceedings,\" the police said.",
