        "title": "Rapido gets 5-year cab licence from Karnataka government, valid till August 2031",
        "link": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/rapido-gets-5-year-cab-licence-from-karnataka-government-valid-till-august-2031/articleshow/133220667.cms",
