        "title": "SAD chief Sukhbir Singh Badal injured in attack in Maharashtra’s Nanded",
        "link": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095005/sad-chief-sukhbir-singh-badal-injured-in-attack-in-maharashtras-nanded?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
