        "title": "LeBlanc, U.S. counterpart meeting again after Canada displeased with latest tariff offer",
        "link": "https://www.cbc.ca/news/politics/trade-tariff-talks-canada-us-canada-dominic-leblanc-jamieson-greer-9.7305811?cmp=rss",
        "source": "CBC | Top Stories News",
