        "title": "PM Narendra Modi calls President Maithripala Sirisena, offers full help after deadly blasts leave over 200 dead in Sri Lanka",
        "link": "https://zeenews.india.com/world/pm-narendra-modi-calls-president-maithripala-sirisena-offers-full-help-after-deadly-blasts-leave-over-160-dead-2197502.html",
