        "title": "Christy Knowings, Who Starred in Over 30 Episodes of Nickelodeon’s ‘All That,’ Has Died at 46",
        "link": "https://thoughtcatalog.com/january-nelson/2026/08/christy-knowings-who-starred-in-over-30-episodes-of-nickelodeons-all-that-has-died-at-46/",
