        "title": "‘Ted Lasso’ Season 4 Sets Premiere Day Viewing Record for Apple TV",
        "link": "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/tv/tv-news/ted-lasso-season-4-premiere-ratings-apple-tv-1236673077/",
        "source": "The Hollywood Reporter",
