        "title": "‘Task’ Adds Stephanie Sigman, Alaíde, Rocío Guzmán & Regina Nava To Season 2 Cast",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/task-season-2-cast-stephanie-sigman-hbo-1237032556/",
