        "full_content": "New accessories for Pixel 11 phones are here.\nNew Pixel 11 accessories are here, including brand-new Pixelsnap cases and Pixelsnap Ring Stand colors.\nPixelsnap cases are available in a variety of colors designed to match your phone and style, including one that’s not a color at all. For the first time, we’re excited to offer clear cases that showcase your phone's original design. Other colors include Frost, Obsidian, Pistachio, and Hibiscus for Pixel 11; Canyon, Fog, Olive, and Obsidian for Pixel 11 Pro and 11 Pro XL; and Olive and Obsidian for Pixel 11 Pro Fold.\nWhether you’re looking to protect your device or refresh its look, these cases offer the perfect blend of durability and style. And, they’re Pixelsnap compatible, so you can attach thousands of magnetic accessories.\nWe’re also introducing three new Pixelsnap Ring Stand colors: Canyon, Olive, and Obsidian. It’s all part of elevating your Pixel experience with style and protection built for everyday life.",
