        "image": "https://blog.playstation.com/tachyon/2026/08/4b768117aa6c028c511fe0a417d3d31676411d8f.jpg",
        "full_content": "Inspired by the raw power of Wolverine and Insomniac’s Battle Reborn suit and claws.\nLast month, the team at Insomniac Games and Marvel Games shared lots of new details and reveals at San Diego Comic-Con for Marvel’s Wolverine. Today, we’re giving a first look at the PS5 Digital Edition – Marvel’s Wolverine Battle Yellow Limited Edition Bundle, which features a PS5 Digital Edition that captures the raw ferocity of Wolverine alongside a matching DualSense wireless controller and a game code for Marvel’s Wolverine.\nInspired by Insomniac’s Battle Reborn suit and claws, the PS5 Digital Edition – Marvel’s Wolverine Battle Yellow Limited Edition Bundle will be available globally and channels Logan’s unmistakable intensity through a bold yellow finish. The design brings in Wolverine’s exposed claw marks and lets players peek under the hood of the PS5 Digital Edition and see what’s underneath. The DualSense wireless controller also features furious slashes inspired by his famous claws, giving players a striking way to bring the game into the palm of their hands.\nThe DualSense Wireless Controller – Marvel’s Wolverine Battle Yellow Limited Edition will also be available for standalone purchase globally.\nIt was important for us to capture the primal energy of Wolverine in this new look for the PS5 console, and it has been fantastic collaborating with Insomniac Games and Marvel Games on the design. We worked alongside Jock, the Scottish graphic artist who contributed to the key art for Marvel’s Wolverine and whose work across comics helped inspire the bold, graphic tone of this limited edition design:\n“I wanted to show Wolverine at his fiercest for Marvel’s Wolverine Limited Edition PS5 Console bundle and accessories. I still draw all my artwork traditionally, so the opportunity to marry cutting-edge hardware with the energy and looseness of hand-drawn ink is incredibly exciting. I’m stunned by how well the console and accessories captured the raw energy of the drawing, bringing Wolverine to life in a completely unique way. ”\n– Jock, Graphic Artist\n“His [Jock] illustrative works have the energy and dynamics needed to capture the kinetic and violent nature of our hero. One whose primary interaction with the world is with unbreakable Adamantium claws. Jock’s illustrations are grounded and raw and perfectly personify Wolverine.”\n– Marcus Smith, Insomniac Games\nIf you already own a PS5 (model group – slim) or PS5 Pro console, you’ll be able to purchase PS5 and PS5 Pro Console Covers – Marvel’s Wolverine Battle Yellow Limited Edition in limited quantities through local retailers. These console covers include covers for both PS5 consoles with disc drives, and consoles without disc drives.\nWe’re also revealing another special PS5 Pro console cover design for players looking to channel another side of Wolverine. Inspired by the adamantium bonded to Logan’s skeleton and claws, the PS5 Pro Console Covers – Marvel’s Wolverine Adamantium Limited Edition feature the same dramatic claw-slashed details with a premium metallic finish that evoke Wolverine’s raw power and let players peer into the PS5 Pro console.\nA matching DualSense Wireless Controller – Marvel’s Wolverine Adamantium Limited Edition also features the same metallic finish and will be available for separate standalone purchase. You can purchase the Marvel’s Wolverine Adamantium Limited Edition PS5 Pro console covers and DualSense wireless controller design in limited quantities through local retailers.\nIn Singapore, DualSense Wireless Controller – Marvel’s Wolverine Adamantium Limited Edition will be available exclusively through select retailer channels in limited quantity. More details will be shared on later date through retail channels.\nInsomniac Games is bringing an all-new original action-packed experience with Marvel’s Wolverine, and we hope you enjoy these designs inspired by the game and character. We can’t wait for players to experience Marvel’s Wolverine on PS5 when it launches beginning September 15, 2026.\nMarvel’s Wolverine Limited Edition Bundle and Accessories Purchase Information\nMarvel’s Wolverine PS5 Digital Edition bundle and accessories are available for pre-order starting August 19 at 10 AM local time (except for the PS5 and PS5 Pro Console Covers), with Suggested Retail Price (SRP) as below:\n- PlayStation 5 Digital Edition – Marvel’s Wolverine Battle Yellow Limited Edition Bundle \n  - SGD 849 / MYR 2,799 / IDR 11,399,000 / THB 20,990\n- DualSense Wireless Controller – Marvel’s Wolverine Battle Yellow Limited Edition\n  - SGD 115 / MYR 419 / IDR 1,549,000 / THB 2,890 / PHP 5,411 / VND 2,399,000\n- PlayStation 5 Console Covers – Battle Yellow Limited Edition\n  - SGD 101 / MYR 369 / IDR 1,359,000 / THB 2,590 / PHP 4,767 / VND 2,099,000\n- PlayStation 5 Pro Console Covers – Marvel’s Wolverine Battle Yellow Limited Edition\n  - SGD 101 / MYR 369 / IDR 1,359,000 / THB 2,590\n- PlayStation 5 Pro Console Covers – Marvel’s Wolverine Adamantium Limited Edition\n  - SGD 101 / MYR 369 / IDR 1,359,000 / THB 2,590\n- DualSense Wireless Controller – Marvel’s Wolverine Adamantium Limited Edition\n  - SGD 115 / MYR 419 / IDR 1,549,000 / THB 2,890 / PHP 5,411 / VND 2,399,000\nMarvel’s Wolverine Limited Edition PS5 Console bundle and accessories will be available beginning September 15 in limited quantities. Check our website for more details.",
