        "title": "Matthew McConaughey Says ‘How To Lose A Guy In 10 Days’ Is “The Gift That Keeps On Giving”: “It Still Pays The Best Mailbox Money”",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/matthew-mcconaughey-how-to-lose-a-guy-in-10-days-residuals-1236784930/",
