        "title": "Emilia Jones To Lead The Cast Of Netflix Series ‘The Retrievals’ From Molly Smith Metzler",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/emilia-jones-star-the-retrievals-molly-smith-metzler-1237032854/",
