        "full_content": "Here’s what’s new with Pixel Buds Pro 2 and Pixel Buds 2a.\nPixel Buds are getting even better with new features, plus a new Olive finish for Pixel Buds Pro 2. Here are the details:\n- Dynamic ANC: Pixel Buds Pro 2 will adjust to compensate when subtle shifts in the seal happen, so you still get powerful noise cancellation.\n- Gemini audio control: Adjust your Buds’ settings with Gemini. Just say “Hey Google, turn up the bass.”\n- Pixel Watch sleep sync: Your watch detects when you fall asleep and pauses music, disables touch, and silences notifications, so you can rest undisturbed.\n- Upgraded Live translate: Tap your Buds to trigger listening mode and understand over 70 languages in near real time without touching your phone. And it's not just for listening — speak to someone in your language, and your Pixel phone will play the translation back to the other person in theirs.\nOrder Pixel Buds Pro 2 in Olive starting August 12, and software updates start rolling out in September.",
