        "title": "Google’s most sophisticated foldable: Pixel 11 Pro Fold",
        "link": "https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/devices/pixel/pixel-11-pro-fold/",
        "source": "News from Google",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-13T20:07:01.362570+00:00",
        "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Pixel_11_Pro_Fold_Social.width-1300.png",
        "full_content": "Google’s most sophisticated foldable: Pixel 11 Pro Fold\nPixel 11 Pro Fold is here, and it’s our most sophisticated foldable yet. With a fresh and durable design, stunning (and helpful) new camera visor with HiLight, and unique features that help you throughout your day, this phone is next-level.\nCompact design and enhancements\nPixel 11 Pro Fold is almost 10% lighter and about 1mm thinner than Pixel 10 Pro Fold, so it’s more comfortable to hold in your hand and in your pocket. 1 With even thinner bezels than before for a sleek look, the new Pro Fold comes in our classic Obsidian and brand-new Olive for a pop of color.\nPixel 11 Pro Fold gets an addition to its iconic camera bar: HiLight. It uses LED lights built around the camera’s flash to give you timely, glanceable information. Use HiLight to get color-coded glows for incoming calls from your favorite contacts, or when you’re talking to Gemini hands-free. Over time, you’ll see more capabilities added to HiLight — like message notifications from your favorite contacts.\nA phone built to last\nPixel 11 Pro Fold maintains the same high standard we set last year for durability, with an impressive IP68 dust and water protection rating 2 — but we didn’t stop there.\nThe new glass fiber composite back cover is designed to be nearly impossible to crack. 3 Paired with a new gearless hinge that protects the inner display and a new Super Actua outer display made of ultra-strong ceramic cover glass, this phone is three times more durable than last year’s device, and it’s our most durable Pixel Fold yet. 4\nPlus, Pixel 11 Pro Fold has improved crease performance, thanks to the new hinge’s larger bend radius and thicker glass layer on the inner display. And both displays are 20% brighter than last year at 3600 nits. 5\nYou’ll notice we upgraded charging speeds for Pixel 11 Pro Fold, too. Plug in and get 50% charged in about 30 minutes with 30W wired charging. 6 Or charge wirelessly 20% faster than our last generation Fold phone with up to 25W Qi2.2 built-in. 7 Beyond charging, Pixel 11 Pro Fold has over 24 hours of battery life, so you can confidently get through the day. 8\nNew features for the big screen\nPowered by our new custom Tensor G6 chip and equipped with 16GB of RAM, Pixel 11 Pro Fold delivers smooth, speedy performance and is designed for Gemini Intelligence. 9\nThe dual screens on Pixel 11 Pro Fold are ideal for real-time translation, especially with our new sign-to-text feature. Developed in partnership with the Deaf community, it lets signers express themselves in Live Transcribe and Gboard in their native language. 10 Pixel 11 Pro Fold’s hands-free form factor makes setting up for signing easy, and can be used with both one-handed and two-handed signing. Sign American Sign Language to the front camera and translations will appear on the outer display.\nAnd bubbles have been optimized for Fold to make multitasking easy. Turn any app into a bubble and you'll be able to see it on the bottom right corner of your screen when unfolded for quick and easy access.\nFoldable-exclusive features you know and love are here to stay, like Drag and Drop, Split Screen, Instant View, and two new animations for Made You Look. Plus, Pixel 11 Pro Fold is equipped with the same helpful features as the rest of the Pixel 11 lineup, including proactive assistance 11 , and improved Circle to Search integration with Pixel Camera. 12\nA camera for moments you can’t retake\nFrom detailed landscape shots to extreme close-ups, you’ll get crisp, beautiful images every time thanks to a new 48MP main camera and telephoto camera with up to 30x Super Zoom. New features for the Pixel 11 series like Magic Capture and Camera Looks allow you to elevate and personalize your photos by capturing the perfect moment when your subject is in motion and providing customizable Looks that bring your unique vision to life.\nOrder Pixel 11 Pro Fold today\nPixel 11 Pro Fold is available for pre-order today and hits shelves on August 20. And be sure to check out our new Pixel 11 Pro Fold case with an integrated hinge cover for added protection.\nVisit the Google Store for more information on availability and product updates.",
