        "full_content": "What is Paytm Postpaid?\nPaytm Postpaid gives users access to a short-term credit limit that can be used across millions of merchants accepting Paytm UPI payments. The credit line is provided by Suryoday Small Finance Bank, while Paytm enables users to access and manage it through the Paytm app.\nOnce activated, users can:\n- Scan and pay at all QR codes.\n- Make payments on websites and apps that support Paytm UPI.\n- Pay bills, recharge their phones, and book tickets through the Paytm app.\n- Access a credit limit of up to ₹60,000, which can also be increased depending on your repayment pattern and usage history.\n- Get 45 days to repay the amount.\nIn short, Paytm Postpaid acts as a financial cushion for those moments when your account balance is low, but your responsibilities aren’t.\nTurn Your Payments Into Paytm Gold Coins\nNow, every payment through Paytm Postpaid can be even more rewarding.\nFor every payment you make, you’ll receive:\n- An assured 50 Paytm Gold Coins\n- A chance to win up to 10,000 Paytm Gold Coins\n- Rewards on every payment, not just your first one\n- Instant reward through a scratch card in the Paytm app\n- Rewards without any minimum payment amount requirement\nWhether you’re paying for groceries on the 28th of the month or purchasing train tickets before payday, every payment becomes an opportunity to earn more.\nHow does the offer work?\nThe process is simple.\nStep 1\nComplete your payment through Paytm Postpaid.\nStep 2\nReceive a scratch card instantly in the Paytm app.\nStep 3\nReveal your reward and collect your Paytm Gold Coins.\nStep 4\nTrack your balance by opening the Cashback & Offers section in the app.\nStep 5\nConvert your accumulated Paytm Gold Coins into real gold.\nFor context, one Paytm Gold Coin is equivalent to ₹0.01 worth of Gold.\nUnlike many rewards programmes that are limited to a user’s first payment, this offer rewards you every time you make an eligible payment.\nThat means the benefits don’t stop after a single purchase.\nYour monthly grocery bill, utility payment, medicine purchase, metro recharge, or travel booking could all help you accumulate Paytm Gold Coins over time.\nAnd because Paytm Postpaid works across millions of merchants, you’ll have plenty of opportunities to use it when you need it most.\nReady to get started?\nActivate Paytm Postpaid in the Paytm app, complete the quick setup process, and start earning Paytm Gold Coins on every payment.\nBecause running low on money shouldn’t mean missing out on opportunities.\nAnd if you’re making payments anyway, why not turn them into gold?\nFAQs\nWhat is Paytm Postpaid?\nPaytm Postpaid is Paytm’s Credit on Paytm UPI offering that allows eligible users to access a credit limit of up to ₹60,000.\nHow many Paytm Gold Coins will I receive?\nYou are guaranteed to receive 50 Paytm Gold Coins on every Paytm Postpaid payment and may win up to 10,000 Paytm Gold Coins.\nWill I receive rewards only on my first payment?\nNo. Eligible users receive rewards on every qualifying payment made through Paytm Postpaid.\nWhere can I check my Paytm Gold Coins balance?\nOpen the Paytm app and visit the Cashback & Offers section to view your accumulated Paytm Gold Coins balance.\nCan Paytm Gold Coins be converted into gold?\nYes. Accumulated Paytm Gold Coins can be converted into Gold.\nIs there a minimum payment amount required to receive rewards?\nNo. The offer is applicable irrespective of the payment amount.",
