        "title": "Paytm Payment Gateway Integrates with Anthropic's Claude via MCP Connector to Access Payment Details Through AI Prompts",
        "link": "https://paytm.com/blog/payment-gateway/paytm-payment-gateway-integrates-with-anthropics-claude-via-mcp-connector-to-access-payment-details-through-ai-prompts/",
        "source": "A Comprehensive Guide to Money Transfer, Recharges, Bill Payments and Other Digital Payments | Paytm Blog",
