        "title": "Some Payments Are Just Personal: Hide Payments on Paytm",
        "link": "https://paytm.com/blog/payment-gateway/some-payments-are-just-personal-hide-payments-on-paytm/",
        "source": "A Comprehensive Guide to Money Transfer, Recharges, Bill Payments and Other Digital Payments | Paytm Blog",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-13T20:07:01.361897+00:00",
        "image": "https://wpblogassets.paytm.com/paytmblog/uploads/2026/08/MD-5352-_-Hide-Payments-Blog-4.png",
        "full_content": "Some payments are easy to talk about. Splitting a dinner bill, ordering your usual coffee, or paying for that weekend plan everyone has been discussing.\nAnd then there are some payments that are just personal.\nMaybe it is a surprise gift you do not want someone to discover. Maybe it is a late-night food order that needs absolutely no explanation. Or maybe you simply prefer keeping certain things to yourself. Honestly, fair enough.\nNot every payment needs to be visible in your payment history. That is where the Hide Payments feature on Paytm comes in.\nKeep Your Personal Payments Personal\nWith Paytm, you can hide specific payments from your main payment history and keep selected Paytm UPI payments more private. The feature gives you greater control over how you view your mobile payments, especially when there are a few payments you would rather keep to yourself.\nThink about it. You might be showing someone something on your phone, scrolling through your payment history, or handing your device to a friend for a quick second. Some payments simply do not need to become part of the conversation.\nWith Hide Payments on Paytm, they do not have to.\nNo awkward questions. No unnecessary explanations. Just more privacy and control over your payment history.\nHow to Hide Payments on Paytm\nHiding a payment on Paytm is simple. Open your payment history, select the payment you want to hide, and choose the option to hide it.\nOnce hidden, the payment will no longer appear in your regular payment history. You can still access your hidden payments whenever you need them, making it easy to manage your Paytm UPI payments while keeping certain ones out of your everyday view.\nAnd when you want to view them again, you can securely access them using your PIN.\nA Little More Privacy, Your Way\nWe use mobile payments for all kinds of things every day. Some are routine, some are memorable, and some are simply nobody else’s business.\nThat is exactly what Hide Payments on Paytm is for.\nIt gives you more control over your payment history and lets you decide which payments stay visible and which ones you would rather keep private.\nBecause privacy does not always mean you are hiding something dramatic. Sometimes, you just want a little personal space. So the next time you make a payment that you would prefer to keep to yourself, remember that you can hide payments on Paytm.\nSome payments are meant to be seen. Some are just personal. With Paytm, the choice is yours.",
