        "title": "The Future of Data Analytics: Why AI is rewriting the Analyst’s Job Description",
        "link": "https://www.databricks.com/blog/future-data-analytics-why-ai-rewriting-analysts-job-description",
        "source": "Databricks",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
