        "title": "As U.S. graduate financing changes, affordability by design matters more",
        "link": "https://blog.coursera.org/as-u-s-graduate-financing-changes-affordability-by-design-matters-more/",
        "source": "Coursera Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
