        "title": "Coursera invests in LearnVector to build the future of AI-native learning",
        "link": "https://blog.coursera.org/coursera-invests-in-learnvector-to-build-the-future-of-ai-native-learning/",
        "source": "Coursera Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
