        "title": "Confidential computing and the new regulatory focus on data in use",
        "link": "https://ubuntu.com//blog/confidential-computing-and-the-new-regulatory-focus-on-data-in-use",
        "source": "Ubuntu blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-13T20:07:01.360855+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-13T20:06:17.922774+00:00",
