        "title": "Ubuntu’s virtualization hardware enablement (HWE) stack: a new model for confidential computing enablement",
        "link": "https://ubuntu.com//blog/ubuntu-virtualization-hwe-stack-confidential-computing",
        "source": "Ubuntu blog",
