        "title": "MiniDXNN v0.4.0: Interactive neural texture compression on DirectX 12",
        "link": "https://gpuopen.com/learn/minidxnn-v040-interactive-neural-texture-compression/",
        "source": "AMD GPUOpen",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
