        "title": "Malcolm Gladwell would rather have a dad who makes $100,000 than $1 billion: Extreme wealth is ‘quite crippling to your motivation’",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/author-malcolm-gladwell-extreme-wealth-crippling-to-motivation-ambition-shaped-by-hardship-career-advice/",
