Mind AI division in which its chief, Demis Hassabis, stepped aside in favor of his deputy, Koray Kavukcuoglu. At the same time, the two original technical co-leads of Gemini quit to co-found a startup. \n\t* CEO Sundar Pichai mounted a robust defense of Google's AI strategy during its earnings call in July, pushing back on concerns that the company has fallen behind rivals after delaying the flagship model and ceding ground in AI coding.\nMore From This Section\nDon't miss the most important news and views of the day. Get them on our Telegram channel\nFirst Published: Aug 13 2026 | 11:53 PM IST",
