        "title": "Noel Tata’s Tata Group power play: How the trusts, family & next gen shape its future",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/corporate/story/noel-tatas-tata-group-power-play-how-the-trusts-family-next-generation-shape-its-future-548964-2026-08-13?utm_source=rssfeed",
