        "title": "How Gen Z start-up founders are rewriting the country’s innovation playbook",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/magazine/deep-dive/story/how-gen-z-start-up-founders-are-rewriting-the-countrys-innovation-playbook-548202-2026-08-10?utm_source=rssfeed",
        "source": "Business News India: Latest Business News Today, Share Market, Economy",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-13T20:07:01.360148+00:00",
