        "title": "The Gulf’s AI boom is driving the race to control the data highways",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/the-gulf-ai-boom-is-driving-the-race-to-control-the-data-highways/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
