        "title": "Record heatwave grips Asia as potatoes ‘boil’ in fields, lions perish",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/record-heatwave-grips-asia-as-potatoes-boil-in-fields-lions-perish-11786631770765.html",
        "source": "mint - news",
