    {
        "title": "A ban on an entire batch and a U-turn later, Bar Council seeks Nalsar report on anti-CJI campaign",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/nalsar-bar-council-of-india-u-turn-anti-cji-campaign-lawyers-legal-11786630878474.html",
